#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:14
msgid ""
"Moves the specified prefixes (``prefix1``, ``prefix2``, ...) from the "
"beginning to the end of ``text``. Any number of prefixes can be specified, "
"separated by commas. If no prefix is specified \"A\" and \"The\" are used by "
"default. Note that the matching is case-sensitive. Do not include a trailing "
"space in a prefix, as the space following the prefix is handled "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

